      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Proceeding from analysis of hemodynamic parameters at the time of paroxysmal supraventricular arrhythmia in 333 CHD patients observed by a specialized first aid cardiological team, differentiated therapy of these arrhythmias was proposed with relation to the nature of arrhythmia and the hemodynamic status at the time of arrhythmia. A method was proposed for the detection of a hemodynamic variant at the time of occurrence of paroxysmal arrhythmia according to clinical manifestations without resort to instrumental methods of investigation."},
